          "1. See Sour Service Definition and Material Requirements in Owner's Specification GS 1.0.",
          "2. Maximum Spectacle Blind size shall be 1NPS. A blind and spacer shall be used for larger pipe sizes. Spectacle Blind material shall be A516 Gr.70N. For low temperature service, material shall be Charpy V-notch tested at temperatures 3\u00b0C warmer than the minimum metal design temperature.",
